---
import Button from "../../shared/Button.astro";
import Badge from "../../shared/Badge.astro";
import { Sparkle } from "@lucide/astro";
import Container from "../../shared/Container.astro";
---

<section class="w-full py-20 lg:py-32 h-screen bg-linear-to-b/decreasing from-surface-primary-light to-surface-background overflow-hidden">
  <Container class="flex flex-start gap-6 items-center relative z-10">
    <div
      class="self-stretch flex flex-col w-full justify-start items-start gap-7 scroll-reveal"
    >
      <Badge variant="default" class="bg-surface-primary-light animate-pulse">
        <Sparkle class="h-4 w-4" />
        <span class="text-base font-medium"
          >Marki, tu amigo que sabe de marketing</span
        >
      </Badge>

      <h1
        class="xl:text-8xl md:text-6xl sm:text-5xl text-4xl font-bold text-primary-800 tracking-[-3px] leading-[1.05]"
      >
        Dejá de pensar <br /> qué postear y <br />
        <span class="text-primary"
          >empezá a <span class="underline decoration-wavy">crecer</span></span
        >
      </h1>
      <p
        class="justify-center text-primary-700 lg:text-2xl md:text-xl text-lg w-full lg:w-[85%] font-medium leading-relaxed tracking-tight"
      >
        Marki te arma el calendario del mes: qué subir, cuando y por qué. Vos solo
        aprobás y publicás. Sin marketing-speak, sin perder horas frente a la
        pantalla.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <Button
          type="rounded"
          variant="primary"
          class="shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          Agendar una demo
        </Button>
        <Button
          type="rounded"
          variant="secondary"
          class="shadow-sm hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          Ver como funciona
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="hidden lg:flex w-3/4 flex-col scroll-reveal delay-300 relative"
    >
      <img
        src="/ilustration-hero.svg"
        class="w-[85%] self-start h-auto animate-float transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] hover:animate-none duration-500"
        alt="Generación de contenido de Marki"
      />
      <img
        src="/marki-suggest.svg"
        class="w-[55%] self-end mt-[-22%] mr-[5%] z-10 h-auto animate-float-delayed transition-transform hover:-translate-y-2 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:animate-none duration-500"
        alt="Generación de contenido de Marki"
      />
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>


